    "sub_name": "行銷企劃與實戰",
    "sub_ename": "MARKETING PLANNING AND EXECUTION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程著重於行銷企劃與執行之實戰能力發展，藉此培育學生以系統性及邏輯性思考來提升行銷企劃能力；以規劃、執行、考核提升執行能力；以產品、虛實通路、數位行銷提升市場整合能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the capability development of marketing planning and execution in the real world. Hence, students can improve their planning capability through systematic and logical thinking ; improve their execution capability through planning, execution and assessment; and improve their market integration capabilities through products, online and offline channels, and digital marketing.",
